1
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
[Netero] This is a tomb.

2
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Yours, as a matter of fact.

3
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Grateful for everything
that's led me to this point,

4
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:50,000
and to you.

5
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,000
[opening theme music playing]

6
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:02,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

7
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:35,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

8
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:39,000
[singer singing in English]

9
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:56,000
[singer singing in English]

10
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:01,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

11
00:02:18,000 --> 00:02:20,000
ZERO X AND X ROSE

12
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:30,000
[blows striking]

13
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,000
[gasps]

14
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:44,000
[dramatic music playing]

15
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:50,000
…unreserved admiration
for his enemy.

16
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,000
[Netero] Hmm.

17
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:09,000
[King] That's it.

18
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:15,000
The attack begins only after
he brings his hands together,

19
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:17,000
and from what I can tell

20
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:19,000
that's the only motion
that surpasses my speed.

21
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:24,000
Such wasteful movement

22
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:36,000
I won't waste precious time
to guess what drove him to this.

23
00:05:07,000 --> 00:05:08,000
[thudding]

24
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:15,000
[dramatic music playing]

25
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:37,000
of time and effort on your part,
and I recognize that.

26
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:42,000
[Netero] All that, and there's
barely a scratch on him.

27
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:45,000
Well, I expected as much.

28
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:59,000
You are a rare example
of one who's transcended that limit.

29
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:09,000
[Netero] Why, you little…

30
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:13,000
An insect like you
should never talk down to humans!

31
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:18,000
[gasps]

32
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:41,000
If the 100-Type Guanyin Bodhisattva

33
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:07,000
Once I've identified

34
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:10,000
all of the combinations
of potential plays,

35
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:22,000
However, while he may have

36
00:07:22,000 --> 00:07:25,000
a finite number of attack patterns,

37
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:27,000
the number of combinations
in which they can be used

38
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:29,000
may as well be infinite.

39
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:48,000
If I can just ascertain

40
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:50,000
the characteristics of his rhythm,

41
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:52,000
then I stand a fair chance of predicting

42
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:55,000
which patterns
he's most likely to select.

43
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:05,000
but I will have to thread it
with utmost precision.

44
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:09,000
That's what it'll take
to pierce my target.

45
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:11,000
This may be a heavy undertaking.

46
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:18,000
I can do this!

47
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:23,000
Old soldier, I beg of you.

48
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:26,000
It will happen soon,

49
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:28,000
so don't collapse before then.

50
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:31,000
[laughs]

51
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:50,000
I can't make a single wrong move.

52
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:51,000
One misstep, and his speed

53
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:54,000
won't leave enough time
to unleash my next hand,

54
00:09:04,000 --> 00:09:06,000
This is a battle of endurance,

55
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:21,000
That's what you're thinking,
isn't it, King of Ants?

56
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:23,000
Fine, then.

57
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:25,000
I'll checkmate you shortly.

58
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:28,000
[Netero] Checkmate me if you can,

59
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:30,000
but I won't make it easy.

60
00:09:30,000 --> 00:09:33,000
I'll show you the Zero Hand!

61
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:30,000
Stop the bleeding,
and tell me what my name is.

62
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:32,000
You have done well…

63
00:10:32,000 --> 00:10:34,000
for a human, of course.

64
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:55,000
-[Netero grunts]
-[gasps]

65
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:05,000
You really think I'll die?

66
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:09,000
It was one lucky punch,
so don't get cocky.

67
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:11,000
This battle is only beginning.

68
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:15,000
You have truly earned my admiration.

69
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:16,000
With everything that's happened thus far,

70
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:18,000
your spirit has yet to diminish.

71
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:29,000
while not exactly bad,
was not the best choice.

72
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:36,000
I learned the art
of anticipating an enemy's actions.

73
00:11:38,000 --> 00:11:40,000
Your subconscious bias
against certain patterns

74
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:43,000
gives me insight
into the otherwise limitless options

75
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:47,000
you have at your disposal,
which gives me the edge.

76
00:12:02,000 --> 00:12:04,000
did not even last a full minute.

77
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:11,000
[Netero] This is it,
the last time in my life!

78
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:13,000
[narrator] As he released

79
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:16,000
his 100-Type Guanyin Bodhisattva,

80
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:20,000
Netero's resolve heightened
his physical and mental senses.

81
00:12:29,000 --> 00:12:33,000
causing sparks that
showered them like fountains.

82
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:46,000
the imperceptible bias
in Netero's moves,

83
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:51,000
a bias so slight it couldn't
even be called a habit.

84
00:12:52,000 --> 00:12:57,000
After using his body to bear the brunt
of Netero's unrelenting attacks,

85
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:08,000
[intense music playing]

86
00:13:27,000 --> 00:13:30,000
What is it? What is my name?

87
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:40,000
[laughs]

88
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:41,000
The King of the Ants.

89
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:45,000
I don't need arms to pray.

90
00:13:45,000 --> 00:13:46,000
Far from it.

91
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:48,000
Huh?

92
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:50,000
[chorus vocalizing]

93
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:53,000
[Netero] Prayer is an action of the heart.

94
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:08,000
and the wish then bears fruit.

95
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:48,000
that he changed his direction.

96
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:52,000
The entirety of Netero's aura

97
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:56,000
was transformed into a light
much like a dazzling star,

98
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:51,000
[Netero groaning]

99
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:37,000
[groans]

100
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:41,000
[King] Truly the pinnacle of mankind.

101
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:02,000
I freely admit it was a brilliant attack.

102
00:17:04,000 --> 00:17:06,000
[Netero] Zero wasn't enough?

103
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:11,000
[King] I was born
to be the King of the Ants,

104
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:14,000
the crowning glory of life.

105
00:17:17,000 --> 00:17:21,000
I represent the instinctive hope
long nurtured by my species,

106
00:17:21,000 --> 00:17:25,000
a species that continues
to evolve for my sake.

107
00:17:33,000 --> 00:17:37,000
You are but one lowly human, not a king.

108
00:17:37,000 --> 00:17:40,000
I am the King that bears
the fate of his kind,

109
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:50,000
is focused on the end point
of all evolution.

110
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:52,000
That end point is me.

111
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:20,000
with a preserve
for a permanent settlement.

112
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:24,000
We'll consider both quality and quantity

113
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:31,000
[narrator] The King could not
savor his name

114
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:33,000
as it fell from the old man's lips,

115
00:19:33,000 --> 00:19:35,000
an old man who should, by all rights,

116
00:19:35,000 --> 00:19:37,000
be trembling before him,

117
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:40,000
yet Netero did not.

118
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:02,000
[imperceptible]

119
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:12,000
within the human heart.

120
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:14,000
[narrator] Just then,

121
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:18,000
the King felt true fear
for the first time.

122
00:20:28,000 --> 00:20:32,000
made it clear he meant every single word.

123
00:21:19,000 --> 00:21:21,000
[explosion]

124
00:22:06,000 --> 00:22:08,000
[closing theme music playing]

125
00:22:09,000 --> 00:22:12,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

126
00:23:36,000 --> 00:23:39,000
[Gon] I'll believe in my friends,
no matter what.

127
00:23:39,000 --> 00:23:42,000
[Gon and Killua]
Thank you, Chairman Netero.

128
00:23:43,000 --> 00:23:45,000
[singer singing in Japanese]
